{"conclusion":"Contextual review confirmed issue","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"892e7f4e81370143ec27a52531486274cfa8096cc53522c812780b61f5a630e8","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"技能树专名与译名库不一致：mod-tome/data/talents/gifts/malleable-body.lua(commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63, L36-41 info)中的 Oozing Blades / Corrosive Blades 是 gifts.lua L42-43 定义的 talent type（newTalentType type=\"wild-gift/oozing-blades\" / \"wild-gift/corrosive-blades\"），本仓库既有译名为 mod-tome.lua:25030 \"oozing blades\"→\"软泥利刃\"、25032 \"corrosive blades\"→\"腐蚀利刃\"，而本条译作\"软泥之刃系技能树\"\"腐蚀之刃技能树\"，玩家在技能面板看到的树名与说明文字对不上。次要：\"all resistances\"译作\"所有抵抗\"，与 UI 规范译法冲突——terminology/combat.tsv:144 \"Resistances→抗性\"为 preferred，mod-tome.lua:6058 \"All resistances\"→\"全体抗性\"，且同批 a7e93f3c 条目同一源短语译作\"全体抗性\"；combat.tsv:48 \"resistance→抵抗\"仅为 existing（效果子类型语境），不支持此处用法。","sha256":"100d4078a39cd6fd8ca6fbae9ebdf4aabaa2bbe98c5619c5c8b3b372fcc7e30d"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"eb4b1ee6122195edd2f66790b160198061ba646af731223353fb22be4d578549","observation_sha256":"100d4078a39cd6fd8ca6fbae9ebdf4aabaa2bbe98c5619c5c8b3b372fcc7e30d","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"Contextual review confirmed issue","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a7b387cf7d2d1b9f932ddec3f1443218c888bbf36fb173b20431106d09a15214","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"包含关系译反。源码 mod-tome/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua(commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63, L4393-4401，唯一物品 Umbraphage，unided_name \"deep black lantern\")原文为 \"This lantern of pale white crystal holds a sphere of darkness, that yet emanates light\"，即灯内盛着一颗黑暗之球、而该球仍放出光芒；译文\"这个灰白色水晶制成的灯笼周围笼罩着一片黑暗\"把\"灯内含有黑暗球体\"改成\"灯外被黑暗笼罩\"，方位与容纳关系颠倒，且丢失了 \"a sphere of darkness\"（黑暗球体）这一实体，与下句\"光之所在，黑暗尽除\"及该神器噬影的设定自相矛盾。","sha256":"903a5126c64dd6ad4ed2df0bb15b2a9fb76d09246abe904ac84b29630a74f317"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"63fd7759ab8b57ed8649a920b4e4a0d3443b81f2ecbd851fc5203a9c4e256e64","observation_sha256":"903a5126c64dd6ad4ed2df0bb15b2a9fb76d09246abe904ac84b29630a74f317","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
